    "### Function for the random step\n",
    "create the random increments of a time series as random walk \n",
    "\n",
    "$DX$ is the standard deviation, $bias$ is the constant average of the step"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
